WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
You are more than your résumé.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.800
You are the relationships you have built,
the knowledge you have accumulated,

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:13.000
the experiences that have shaped you,
and the possibilities that lie ahead.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Your professional identity should not be confined to a single platform.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.800
Your career evolves. Your connections grow.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:24.500
Your opportunities change.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.500
Your professional world should travel with you.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.500
Introducing the vision behind AnewSphere.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.500
AnewConnect. Own Your Connections.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:40.500
AnewPath. Own Your Future.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:44.500
AnewID. Own Your Identity.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:47.000
One emerging ecosystem

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.500
built around people, not platforms.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.500
We are inviting our Founding Circle

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:56.000
to help shape what comes next.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Your professional world. Your terms.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.000
AnewSphere.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Own Your Sphere.
